Unsupervised Learning and Transformers (EX5)

Exploration of PCA geometry, top-down clustering, multi-head attention,
and GPT-2 static and contextualized embedding spaces.

Contents:
- Notebook: PCA and K-means analysis on GPT-2 static token embeddings
  (first 10,000 tokens, K=100) and contextualized representations across
  layers for a polysemous token.
- Theoretical / Written Work: Subspace projections and reconstruction error
  in PCA, top-down K-means clustering properties, and Multi-Head Attention
  head permutation analysis.
